      "english": "Today I wanted to go to the library, but I didn't know the way."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "她很生气，没有回答我。",
      "traditional": "她很生氣，沒有回答我。",
      "pinyin": "tā hěn shēng qì méi yǒu huí dá wǒ",
      "english": "I asked a girl: “Miss, how do I get to the library?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "后来丽丽和我说中国人不喜欢被叫“小姐”。",
      "traditional": "後來麗麗和我說中國人不喜歡被叫“小姐”。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái lì lì hé wǒ shuō zhōng guó rén bù xǐ huan bèi jiào xiǎo jie",
      "english": "She got very angry and didn't answer me."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "所以，以后我在学校问路，我要说：“同学，请问图书馆怎么走？”",
      "traditional": "所以，以後我在學校問路，我要說：“同學，請問圖書館怎麼走？”",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ yǐ hòu wǒ zài xué xiào wèn lù wǒ yào shuō tóng xué qǐng wèn tú shū guǎn zěn me zǒu",
      "english": "Afterwards Lili told me that Chinese people don't like to be called “Miss”."
    }
