    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben's Diary — Don't Call Out “Miss”",
      "",
      "2017-08-01 Very cloudy",
      "",
      "Today I wanted to go to the library, but I didn't know the way.",
      "I asked a girl: “Miss, how do I get to the library?”",
      "She got very angry and didn't answer me.",
      "Afterwards Lili told me that Chinese people don't like to be called “Miss”.",
      "So next time I ask for directions at school, I will say: “Classmate, how do I get to the library?”"
